# BasedAgents observatory probe — tmux one-liner (daemon mode).
# Runs probe.py in a detached tmux session; the daemon aligns rounds
# to wall-clock 5-minute boundaries itself. EDIT the paths and the
# --vantage label for your deployment.
#
# Start:
tmux new-session -d -s observatory "python3 /opt/basedagents-observatory/probe.py --daemon --interval 5 --vantage vantage-a --out /var/lib/basedagents-observatory/samples.jsonl"
#
# Watch it:
#   tmux attach -t observatory
# Stop it (the probe writes a probe_stop record on SIGTERM):
#   tmux send-keys -t observatory C-c
